silk backs out of the storehouse. “Everyone's taking something. Want to stop me? Play me for it.”\", \"一个人抱着满怀宫中绸缎从库房退出来。“人人都在拿。你想拦我？跟我下一局。”\", \"f2b55c00432b\"]]"},{"name":"win","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“…Fine. Fine! It's back on the shelf.”\", \"“……好吧，好吧！放回架上就是。”\", \"c238feda83f3\"]]"},{"name":"done","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"The silk is back on the shelf.\", \"绸缎已放回架上。\", \"c1005bb2eeca\"]]"}]},{"id":71,"name":"exit-luoyang--jiade-hall","type":"exit","x":201.6,"y":125.6,"width":12.8,"height":12.0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"luoyang--jiade-hall"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":72,"name":"exit-luoyang--sheng-hall","type":"exit","x":425.6,"y":125.6,"width":12.8,"height":12.0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"luoyang--sheng-hall"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":73,"name":"exit-luoyang","type":"exit","x":256,"y":480,"width":32,"height":16,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"luoyang"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"S"}]},{"id":74,"name":"entry-luoyang--jiade-hall","type":"entry","x":216.0,"y":142.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"from","type":"string","value":"luoyang--jiade-hall"}]},{"id":75,"name":"entry-luoyang--sheng-hall","type":"entry","x":440.0,"y":142.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"from","type":"string","value":"luoyang--sheng-hall"}]},{"id":76,"name":"entry-luoyang","type":"entry","x":264.0,"y":478.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"from","type":"string","value":"luoyang"}]},{"id":77,"name":"entry","type":"entry","x":216.0,"y":142.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true}]}]}